    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D first-person walking simulator, where you'll take a leisurely stroll through a world of poolcore and bloomcore aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of this game is to provide a pleasant\u00a0and relaxing experience\u2014no monsters, no jump scares, and no mandatory objectives. You\u2019re free to wander at your own pace and fully immerse yourself in this strange, unique world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A combination of poolcore and bloomcore art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Relaxing and smooth gaming experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Immersive first-person perspective gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Duration: 30 - 60 minuetes</p>",
